AltoConvexCreditLineMarket::setBorrowOpeningFee()
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when new opening fee exceeds MATH_PRECISION
│   └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketInvalidInput
└── when new opening fee is at most MATH_PRECISION
    ├── it should update borrowOpeningFee
    ├── when new value equals current value
    │   └── it should still emit and leave the same value
    └── it should emit SetBorrowOpeningFee with old and new values
